1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,893
Why do so many traders care about sixty one point eight percent?

2
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:08,934
A Fibonacci retracement is drawn from a swing low to a swing high.

3
00:00:09,303 --> 00:00:16,414
It marks levels at twenty three point six, thirty eight point two, fifty and sixty one point eight percent of the move.

4
00:00:16,914 --> 00:00:21,184
When price pulls back, traders watch those levels for a place where it might pause.

5
00:00:21,532 --> 00:00:26,199
This time, it held near sixty one point eight percent, and buyers stepped back in.

6
00:00:26,699 --> 00:00:27,859
But they aren't magic.

7
00:00:28,267 --> 00:00:32,672
They work best when they line up with other support, and price misses them all the time.

8
00:00:33,172 --> 00:00:36,706
Fibonacci is one of the drawing tools on Meme Street's charts.

9
00:00:37,045 --> 00:00:38,881
Practise at memestreet.net.

